{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"DHI-uceg-znfa-66fp-5oea","published":"2026-11-11T15:54:32Z","modified":"2026-11-20T14:45:48.142111319Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-45570"],"summary":"go-git is an extensible git implementation library written in pure Go. Prior to 5.19.1 and 6.0.0-alpha.4, go-git's SSH…","details":"go-git is an extensible git implementation library written in pure Go. Prior to 5.19.1 and 6.0.0-alpha.4, go-git's SSH transport constructs the remote exec command by wrapping the repository path in single quotes without escaping single quotes embedded inside the path. A repository path containing a single quote can therefore break out of the quoted region in the exec command and be appended as additional shell tokens. This vulnerability is fixed in 5.19.1 and 6.0.0-alpha.4.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"grype-dev","ecosystem":"Docker Hardened Images:Alpine:3.23","purl":"pkg:apk/dhi/grype-dev"},"versions":["0.109.0-r0","0.109.0-r1","0.109.1-r1","0.109.1-r2","0.109.1-r3","0.109.1-r4","0.110.0-r0","0.110.0-r1","0.111.0-r0","0.111.0-r1","0.111.1-r0","0.112.0-r0","0.112.0-r1","0.112.0-r2","0.112.0-r3","0.112.0-r4","0.112.0-r6","0.113.0-r0","0.114.0-r0","0.114.0-r1","0.114.0-r2","0.115.0-r0","0.115.0-r1","0.116.0-r0","0.116.0-r1","0.116.0-r2","0.116.1-r0","0.117.0-r0","0.117.0-r1","0.117.0-r2","0.117.0-r3","0.118.0-r0","0.118.0-r1","0.118.0-r2","0.118.0-r3","0.118.0-r4","0.119.0-r1","0.120.0-r0","0.120.1-r0","0.120.1-r1","0.121.0-r0","0.121.0-r1","0.121.0-r2","0.121.1-r0","0.121.2-r0","0.121.2-r1","0.121.3-r0","0.121.3-r1","0.121.3-r2","0.122.0-r0","0.122.1-r0"],"database_specific":{"owner_kind":"HSP","source":"https://github.com/docker-hardened-images/advisories/blob/main/dhi/osv/2026/DHI-uceg-znfa-66fp-5oea.json"}},{"package":{"name":"grype-fips-dev","ecosystem":"Docker Hardened Images:Alpine:3.23","purl":"pkg:apk/dhi/grype-fips-dev"},"versions":["0.109.0-r0","0.109.0-r1","0.109.1-r1","0.109.1-r2","0.109.1-r3","0.109.1-r4","0.110.0-r0","0.110.0-r1","0.111.0-r0","